865
00:38:30,837 --> 00:38:33,837
It grows on damp ground.

866
00:38:34,207 --> 00:38:37,377
Many restaurants serve seasoned goldmoss stonecrop.

867
00:38:37,807 --> 00:38:40,117
It makes a nice side dish.

868
00:38:40,247 --> 00:38:42,246
Among actors your age, you'd be the most knowledgeable about it.

869
00:38:42,247 --> 00:38:43,516
- Seriously. - Right?

870
00:38:43,517 --> 00:38:45,657
(He collects goldmoss stonecrop after collecting shepherd's purse.)

871
00:38:46,317 --> 00:38:47,587
There's a lot.

872
00:38:51,057 --> 00:38:52,096
(Picking)

873
00:38:52,097 --> 00:38:54,097
So it grows in such places.

874
00:38:54,997 --> 00:38:57,127
(He is busy collecting the goldmoss stonecrop.)

875
00:38:59,197 --> 00:39:00,337
Oh, gosh! That surprised me!

876
00:39:00,997 --> 00:39:02,067
Who is that?

877
00:39:03,307 --> 00:39:04,307
Gosh, how long has it been to come here?

878
00:39:04,307 --> 00:39:05,307
I know.

879
00:39:05,308 --> 00:39:08,606
(Two people approach the house amidst the fog.)

880
00:39:08,607 --> 00:39:10,007
Where is he?

881
00:39:10,881 --> 00:39:13,251
(In Hyuk is busy collecting the goldmoss stonecrop.)

882
00:39:15,051 --> 00:39:16,351
Oh, gosh! That surprised me!

883
00:39:16,891 --> 00:39:17,921
Who is that?

884
00:39:19,121 --> 00:39:20,460
Gosh, how long has it been to come here?

885
00:39:20,461 --> 00:39:22,060
