886
00:39:22,061 --> 00:39:23,531
I don't think it will really matter.

887
00:39:24,431 --> 00:39:25,901
Where is he?

888
00:39:26,101 --> 00:39:27,101
There he is.

889
00:39:27,102 --> 00:39:28,700
