890
00:39:28,701 --> 00:39:30,731
- A bear? - Gosh!

891
00:39:34,671 --> 00:39:36,911
- Bae In Hyuk! - Come out!

892
00:39:38,711 --> 00:39:40,851
- Bae In Hyuk! - Come out!

893
00:39:43,551 --> 00:39:44,920
- What are you doing? - Why are you so late?

894
00:39:44,921 --> 00:39:47,081
I'm collecting these for you guys.

895
00:39:47,251 --> 00:39:48,451
Collect some more.

896
00:39:49,791 --> 00:39:51,460
- Were you collecting them? - Are they his friends?

897
00:39:51,461 --> 00:39:53,491
- Yes. - Your hometown friends?

898
00:39:53,661 --> 00:39:55,930
My friends appeared as if they were in "Guardian."

899
00:39:55,931 --> 00:39:57,831
They're my hometown friends.

900
00:39:58,201 --> 00:39:59,900
In Jeonju,

901
00:39:59,901 --> 00:40:01,970
