902
00:40:01,971 --> 00:40:05,301
We're still great friends to this day.

903
00:40:08,811 --> 00:40:14,041
(Bae In Hyuk's friend, Jeon Chang Ok)

904
00:40:17,821 --> 00:40:19,080
So this is Lee Dong Wook.

905
00:40:19,081 --> 00:40:22,651
