1026
00:45:07,471 --> 00:45:09,471
(Eating)

1027
00:45:09,771 --> 00:45:11,311
- Eat slowly. - Right.

1028
00:45:11,911 --> 00:45:13,041
I have to lose weight.

1029
00:45:13,141 --> 00:45:16,411
(Eating)

1030
00:45:16,851 --> 00:45:18,221
I want to meet that guy.

1031
00:45:18,381 --> 00:45:19,750
He's just like you.

1032
