1033
00:45:21,351 --> 00:45:22,591
"I'm on a diet."

1034
00:45:22,651 --> 00:45:24,960
"I'm going to have two eggs for lunch at the convenience store."

1035
00:45:24,961 --> 00:45:27,691
But during the shoot, he shoves in so much bread.

1036
00:45:30,991 --> 00:45:32,860
Right. He eats more snacks than his meals.

1037
00:45:32,861 --> 00:45:34,871
He follows a diet plan during mealtimes,

1038
00:45:35,301 --> 00:45:36,971
but he eats all he wants regularly.

1039
00:45:37,071 --> 00:45:39,440
Right. He follows a diet plan during mealtimes.

1040
00:45:39,441 --> 00:45:41,070
- Right. - He eats all he wants regularly.

