These are carried around, right?

1304
00:55:36,171 --> 00:55:39,201
(He picks up a shopping bag and gets ready to shop!)

1305
00:55:41,201 --> 00:55:43,370
This is Moo-KEA's plan. In my house,

1306
00:55:43,371 --> 00:55:44,940
(In my house)

1307
