1310
00:55:52,281 --> 00:55:54,481
After becoming a storage room, I didn't want to go in anymore.

1311
00:55:54,921 --> 00:55:58,151
But I sold my oven to Jae Hyeon...

1312
00:55:58,251 --> 00:56:01,221
