1315
00:56:05,701 --> 00:56:09,271
I decided to make this a place I want to go inside again.

1316
00:56:09,601 --> 00:56:10,801
What must I do then?

1317
00:56:11,001 --> 00:56:13,101
I must use Hue-terior.

1318
00:56:13,471 --> 00:56:18,241
When you look at the workrooms of trendy artists,

1319
