Nothing is over the top.

1322
00:56:26,921 --> 00:56:28,791
Everything is simple.

1323
00:56:28,951 --> 00:56:30,451
- Placed nonchalantly. - Right. Placed nonchalantly.

1324
00:56:31,491 --> 00:56:32,991
So chic and placed nonchalantly.

1325
00:56:33,791 --> 00:56:35,630
I wanted to make it look like...

1326
00:56:35,631 --> 00:56:38,701
