1327
00:56:39,031 --> 00:56:40,500
I'm certain of the things I want today.

1328
00:56:40,501 --> 00:56:42,471
Chairs, tables, lights, and decorative items.

1329
00:56:43,671 --> 00:56:44,771
That's everything.

1330
00:56:45,971 --> 00:56:48,340
Chairs, tables, lights, and decorative items? That's everything.

1331
00:56:48,341 --> 00:56:49,771
I won't be buying other furniture.

1332
00:56:50,971 --> 00:56:52,981
Let's fill in the cart.

1333
