1336
00:57:05,051 --> 00:57:06,561
There's a certain style.

1337
00:57:06,821 --> 00:57:09,391
It's like how McDonald's chains look the same everywhere.

1338
00:57:09,491 --> 00:57:11,260
- He's different indeed. - Now,

1339
00:57:11,261 --> 00:57:13,631
