1340
00:57:14,401 --> 00:57:16,100
"The stores look the same in any country."

1341
00:57:16,101 --> 00:57:17,900
It wasn't even a mind-blowing comment.

1342
00:57:17,901 --> 00:57:19,840
- Right. - He accepts it differently.

1343
00:57:19,841 --> 00:57:22,111
I noticed that you're a bit toady.

1344
00:57:22,571 --> 00:57:23,671
It's serious.

1345
00:57:24,911 --> 00:57:28,481
