1353
00:57:47,931 --> 00:57:49,801
It's not bad. I think I'll use it.

1354
00:57:50,131 --> 00:57:51,330
- It does look nice. - No.

1355
00:57:51,331 --> 00:57:53,101
The easel will be placed here.

1356
00:57:54,001 --> 00:57:55,171
This isn't bad.

1357
00:57:58,341 --> 00:57:59,840
It's a chair for children.

1358
00:57:59,841 --> 00:58:02,410
(It's a chair for children.)

1359
00:58:02,411 --> 00:58:03,651
It's a chair for children.

1360
00:58:04,211 --> 00:58:06,781
Oh, like this?

1361
00:58:07,881 --> 00:58:10,051
The light is placed on it like this?

1362
00:58:12,121 --> 00:58:13,521
This looks nice.

1363
00:58:13,961 --> 00:58:16,061
- No. - It's so cute.

1364
00:58:16,531 --> 00:58:19,600
It's far away from your theme of being simple.

1365
