1381
00:58:56,371 --> 00:58:57,601
The color was so pretty.

1382
00:58:57,831 --> 00:58:59,341
- Why would you buy so many cables? - Why would you...

1383
00:59:00,101 --> 00:59:01,101
- Hyun Moo. - Who buys a cable...

1384
00:59:01,102 --> 00:59:02,110
because it's pretty?

1385
