1387
00:59:08,181 --> 00:59:10,851
(Since I sold them, I should get new ones.)

1388
00:59:10,951 --> 00:59:12,350
I'm certain of the things I want today.

1389
00:59:12,351 --> 00:59:14,451
Chairs, tables, lights, and decorative items.

1390
00:59:16,021 --> 00:59:17,091
That's a sort of decorative item.

1391
00:59:19,061 --> 00:59:20,961
I shouldn't get something like this.

1392
00:59:21,791 --> 00:59:22,960
This won't do.

1393
00:59:22,961 --> 00:59:26,401
(His plan failed miserably from the beginning.)

1394
00:59:27,361 --> 00:59:29,870
Goodness. I'm not here to get these.

1395
00:59:29,871 --> 00:59:30,871
(In the end, he nonchalantly added a charging adapter to the cart too.)

1396
00:59:31,301 --> 00:59:33,201
