1397
00:59:33,501 --> 00:59:34,600
A stool?

1398
00:59:34,601 --> 00:59:36,111
(Hyun Moo found the chair section.)

1399
00:59:37,141 --> 00:59:38,410
Gosh, these chairs...

1400
00:59:38,411 --> 00:59:39,411
