1401
00:59:40,081 --> 00:59:41,881
- There are so many pretty chairs. - They have many chairs.

1402
00:59:42,111 --> 00:59:43,481
This one has a really nice vibe.

1403
00:59:45,081 --> 00:59:46,350
(He strides up and takes a seat.)

1404
00:59:46,351 --> 00:59:48,521
Gosh, this chair... A rattan chair.

1405
00:59:48,821 --> 00:59:49,891
I can put something in here.

1406
00:59:50,151 --> 00:59:51,151
(Impressed)

1407
00:59:51,591 --> 00:59:52,920
What if I paint in this chair?

1408
00:59:52,921 --> 00:59:55,990
(What if I paint in this chair?)

1409
00:59:55,991 --> 00:59:58,391
The painting became the standard for buying furniture.

1410
00:59:58,731 --> 00:59:59,860
For the studio.

1411
00:59:59,861 --> 01:00:01,061
It's giving me goosebumps.

1412
01:00:01,231 --> 01:00:04,370
(What if this chair was in my studio?)

1413
01:00:04,371 --> 01:00:06,801
A true artist paints on the floor.

1414
01:00:08,201 --> 01:00:09,671
It'll give a nice vibe to my studio.

1415
01:00:10,241 --> 01:00:12,511
(Shopping cart: Rattan chair)

1416
