1422
01:00:26,861 --> 01:00:27,890
- It was really comfortable. - Gosh.

1423
01:00:27,891 --> 01:00:28,991
- It's pretty, right? - This one is the best.

1424
01:00:29,231 --> 01:00:30,261
This one's pretty.

1425
01:00:31,531 --> 01:00:32,661
This is it.

1426
01:00:33,561 --> 01:00:34,760
There must be another color too.

1427
01:00:34,761 --> 01:00:36,171
Oh, it's this one. The orange chair.

1428
01:00:36,971 --> 01:00:39,201
I'll use that chair for painting.

1429
01:00:40,001 --> 01:00:41,240
(Moosquiat faces a dilemma as a painter.)

1430
01:00:41,241 --> 01:00:42,271
What should I do?

1431
01:00:43,341 --> 01:00:44,511
They have it in this color too.

1432
01:00:45,271 --> 01:00:47,111
- What is this? - That's the latest item.

1433
01:00:47,541 --> 01:00:48,610
That chair in beige...

1434
01:00:48,611 --> 01:00:49,880
- was released for the first time. - Oh, really?

1435
01:00:49,881 --> 01:00:51,351
- It's in beige? - It is.

1436
01:00:53,081 --> 01:00:55,420
"New." I bet even G-DRAGON hasn't bought this yet.

1437
01:00:55,421 --> 01:00:56,551
He's getting it for sure.

1438
01:00:57,351 --> 01:00:58,351
You might as well...

1439
01:00:58,352 --> 01:00:59,360
- get the latest one. - Right?

1440
01:00:59,361 --> 01:01:00,361
Joy, you understand...

1441
01:01:00,361 --> 01:01:01,361
- as a maximalist. - I get you.

1442
01:01:01,362 --> 01:01:02,431
- That's right. - Since you were at it.

1443
01:01:03,131 --> 01:01:04,731
All right.

1444
01:01:05,601 --> 01:01:06,731
What is this?

1445
01:01:09,471 --> 01:01:10,530
What is this section?

1446
01:01:10,531 --> 01:01:11,771
- They have an art studio theme. - It's an art studio.

1447
01:01:12,101 --> 01:01:14,871
That showroom is a great reference for you, Hyun Moo.

1448
01:01:15,201 --> 01:01:17,611
Yes, this is a studio. This space is totally for me.

1449
01:01:19,411 --> 01:01:21,341
Oh, placing a rug like this for a natural vibe?

1450
01:01:22,381 --> 01:01:23,580
- That's nice too. - A vibe like this?

1451
01:01:23,581 --> 01:01:25,481
- It's nice, right? - For the studio.

1452
01:01:26,121 --> 01:01:28,221
It won't look weird even if I get paint on it.

1453
01:01:28,581 --> 01:01:30,221
It's the mindset of Moo-KEA.

1454
01:01:30,491 --> 01:01:32,521
Before, I'd just get one item and place it...

1455
01:01:32,621 --> 01:01:33,820
