1458
01:01:38,231 --> 01:01:41,131
I've developed a sense to see the overall theme.

1459
01:01:41,761 --> 01:01:43,870
I can now mix and match decor items.

1460
01:01:43,871 --> 01:01:46,571
I thought, "When I get something, let's get a proper one."

1461
01:01:47,071 --> 01:01:48,770
I'm definitely getting this.

1462
01:01:48,771 --> 01:01:51,040
(Shopping cart: Rattan chair, latest chair, rug)

1463
01:01:51,041 --> 01:01:54,241
There was a rug this big in the art studio-themed showroom.

1464
01:01:54,411 --> 01:01:55,680
Which one was it?

1465
01:01:55,681 --> 01:01:57,981
It's like the rug you'd see in a lockup cell Chunhyang is in.

1466
01:01:58,451 --> 01:01:59,951
The rug on the floor of Chunhyang's lockup cell.

1467
01:02:00,221 --> 01:02:01,620
(His description is like a riddle.)

1468
01:02:01,621 --> 01:02:03,050
It's Lohals.

1469
01:02:03,051 --> 01:02:04,651
- Yes, it's Lohals. - They understood him.

1470
01:02:04,751 --> 01:02:05,920
- They did. - How did they get you...

1471
01:02:05,921 --> 01:02:07,121
with that kind of description?

1472
01:02:07,421 --> 01:02:09,160
- It's... - Everyone feels the same way.

1473
01:02:09,161 --> 01:02:10,431
It's the straw mat for rolling up a dead body!

1474
01:02:11,061 --> 01:02:12,901
How did you get it after hearing that it's from Chunhyang's cell?

1475
01:02:13,231 --> 01:02:14,300
You're amazing.

1476
01:02:14,301 --> 01:02:16,530
(Hyun Moo goes to the section the staff told him.)

1477
01:02:16,531 --> 01:02:18,101
That's right. Chunhyang's prison cell.

1478
01:02:18,431 --> 01:02:19,541
This is it.

1479
01:02:20,571 --> 01:02:22,170
(He finally found the rug from Chunhyang's prison cell.)

1480
01:02:22,171 --> 01:02:23,611
"Chunhyang's prison cell."

1481
01:02:23,871 --> 01:02:25,070
Everyone gets it.

1482
01:02:25,071 --> 01:02:26,510
- For rolling up a body. - For rolling up a body.

1483
01:02:26,511 --> 01:02:27,581
For rolling up a body.

1484
01:02:27,841 --> 01:02:29,280
(Let's go home with me.)

1485
01:02:29,281 --> 01:02:31,211
I have that rug at home.

1486
01:02:31,481 --> 01:02:32,850
- Oh, he has the same one. - Really?

1487
01:02:32,851 --> 01:02:33,981
You should've told me.

1488
01:02:37,091 --> 01:02:39,661
(Hyun Moo is still browsing.)

1489
