(Where is that cup from?)

1494
01:02:53,741 --> 01:02:55,941
(The cup cost five dollars.)

1495
01:02:56,241 --> 01:02:57,911
(It has a crazy nice vibe.)

1496
01:02:58,071 --> 01:03:00,241
(He wanted to buy all the items that Hue got with his sense.)

1497
01:03:00,781 --> 01:03:02,711
(Hue, I'm getting this cup because of you.)

1498
01:03:04,081 --> 01:03:06,120
- I only use that cup these days. - It's actually different from mine.

1499
01:03:06,121 --> 01:03:07,180
What?

1500
01:03:07,181 --> 01:03:08,650
- I only use that cup these days. - It's actually different from mine.

1501
01:03:08,651 --> 01:03:10,050
- What? - It's different from the cup...

1502
01:03:10,051 --> 01:03:11,450
that you used.

1503
01:03:11,451 --> 01:03:12,590
I didn't get it from IKEA.

1504
01:03:12,591 --> 01:03:14,390
- Please share me a link. - All right.

1505
01:03:14,391 --> 01:03:15,391
(So I can get one again.)

1506
01:03:15,561 --> 01:03:19,031
Actually, I didn't buy that because it was trending.

1507
01:03:19,361 --> 01:03:20,630
I used that cup from an Italian brand...

1508
01:03:20,631 --> 01:03:23,501
for the first time when I was living in LA.

1509
01:03:23,831 --> 01:03:25,330
I remembered...

1510
01:03:25,331 --> 01:03:26,841
- that it had a nice feel. - It must have a story.

1511
01:03:27,141 --> 01:03:29,011
I do have one too. I saw it for the first time at his place.

1512
01:03:29,411 --> 01:03:31,541
- You loved that feel. - I loved that feel.

1513
01:03:31,871 --> 01:03:32,940
I can't forget...

1514
01:03:32,941 --> 01:03:33,981
- how it felt in my hand. - How it felt in your hand?

1515
01:03:34,181 --> 01:03:35,480
Compared to the cup I got...

1516
01:03:35,481 --> 01:03:37,181
- from IKEA, - He's driving me crazy.

1517
01:03:37,351 --> 01:03:39,150
Hue's cup is a bit wider.

1518
01:03:39,151 --> 01:03:40,551
- That's right. - This is how it feels in my hand.

1519
01:03:40,721 --> 01:03:42,721
What you're saying is right, though.

1520
01:03:43,521 --> 01:03:45,390
- You're actually right. - The way it feels in your hand...

1521
01:03:45,391 --> 01:03:47,021
You don't have to align with everything he says.

1522
01:03:48,421 --> 01:03:49,531
Hyun Moo...

1523
01:03:49,691 --> 01:03:51,160
It's this one.

1524
01:03:51,161 --> 01:03:53,400
Hue's lighting.

1525
01:03:53,401 --> 01:03:54,760
(I found Hue's lighting.)

1526
01:03:54,761 --> 01:03:56,030
- This is the one. - That's the one, right?

1527
01:03:56,031 --> 01:03:58,370
- Yes, I have that one too. - That's it. It's simple and nice.

1528
01:03:58,371 --> 01:03:59,401
It's pretty.

1529
01:04:00,201 --> 01:04:01,341
This is Hue's cup.

1530
01:04:01,641 --> 01:04:02,841
Wait, this is Hue's.

1531
01:04:03,211 --> 01:04:05,241
Hue Park. This is it.

1532
01:04:06,011 --> 01:04:07,281
