1533
01:04:07,841 --> 01:04:09,751
Don't they have Hue's fruit plate?

1534
01:04:10,711 --> 01:04:14,381
(He's getting more dizzy.)

1535
01:04:15,451 --> 01:04:18,121
Why do you keep adding his name to every item?

1536
01:04:18,491 --> 01:04:21,220
You must flinch every time he mentions your name.

1537
01:04:21,221 --> 01:04:23,091
It's my first time someone...

1538
01:04:23,331 --> 01:04:25,530
mentions my name this many times, so I'm flustered.

1539
01:04:25,531 --> 01:04:27,631
Doesn't it feel like a new kind of bullying?

1540
01:04:27,801 --> 01:04:28,830
I know.

1541
01:04:28,831 --> 01:04:30,470
- It looks really scary from here. - I mean,

1542
01:04:30,471 --> 01:04:31,630
it's scary for him.

1543
01:04:31,631 --> 01:04:33,371
(He pours out lots of affection for Hue.)

1544
01:04:34,271 --> 01:04:35,370
(Excuse me. I'm looking for Hue's items.)

1545
01:04:35,371 --> 01:04:36,441
Excuse me.

