1569
01:05:26,221 --> 01:05:28,091
It's so pretty. How cute.

1570
01:05:29,161 --> 01:05:30,591
Gosh, that's pretty too.

1571
01:05:31,291 --> 01:05:32,361
It's pretty.

1572
01:05:33,201 --> 01:05:34,701
