1573
01:05:35,231 --> 01:05:36,301
This punk.

1574
01:05:36,931 --> 01:05:39,640
I can put a flower in this vase for a nice vibe.

1575
01:05:39,641 --> 01:05:40,740
This one's good.

1576
01:05:40,741 --> 01:05:42,100
No, you should never get that.

1577
01:05:42,101 --> 01:05:43,671
- This is... - The color is too vivid.

1578
01:05:44,071 --> 01:05:45,141
That's the highlight.

1579
01:05:45,471 --> 01:05:47,010
Every item you got is the highlight.

1580
01:05:47,011 --> 01:05:48,811
I think they're inconsistent.

1581
01:05:49,151 --> 01:05:50,451
I think you're already done...

1582
01:05:51,111 --> 01:05:52,311
with my kind of interior design.

1583
01:05:53,451 --> 01:05:54,951
