And it's a day dedicated to Hue.

2062
01:26:19,922 --> 01:26:21,192
(He even dedicates the room to Hue in the end.)

2063
01:26:22,432 --> 01:26:24,261
(Placing)

2064
01:26:24,262 --> 01:26:25,262
(Hue)

2065
01:26:25,263 --> 01:26:27,101
(Displaying it for easy viewing)

2066
01:26:27,102 --> 01:26:28,871
How come the painting is so funny?

2067
01:26:28,872 --> 01:26:31,201
You used my name for the painting,

2068
01:26:31,202 --> 01:26:33,041
but you drew yourself.

2069
01:26:33,042 --> 01:26:34,972
(Hue)

2070
01:26:35,242 --> 01:26:36,342
It's so pretty.

2071
01:26:37,112 --> 01:26:38,211
I love it.

2072
01:26:38,212 --> 01:26:39,742
(Leaving the room after feeling fully satisfied)

2073
01:26:40,682 --> 01:26:42,412
When will I clean these up? Gosh, I'm so sick of it.

2074
01:26:44,422 --> 01:26:45,551
When will I clean these up?

2075
01:26:45,552 --> 01:26:47,391
It's a lot of work to clean that up.

2076
01:26:47,392 --> 01:26:48,552
When will I clean these up?

2077
01:26:50,662 --> 01:26:52,061
(Plopping down)

2078
01:26:52,062 --> 01:26:54,292
I'm dying. Gosh, my legs.

2079
01:26:57,232 --> 01:26:58,602
Let's clean them up later.

2080
01:27:04,102 --> 01:27:05,671
(Hue)

2081
01:27:05,672 --> 01:27:08,841
(Dreaming of Becoming Hue)

2082
01:27:08,842 --> 01:27:10,312
(Next story)

2083
01:27:10,512 --> 01:27:11,542
All right.

2084
01:27:11,882 --> 01:27:14,452
(A soccer stadium filled with heavy breathing)

2085
01:27:15,082 --> 01:27:17,222
(Someone is commanding the field.)

2086
01:27:17,422 --> 01:27:18,522
Wait for it!

2087
01:27:18,952 --> 01:27:21,822
(And MINHO is waiting next to him?)

2088
01:27:22,492 --> 01:27:24,121
My father is a coach of K League 2.

2089
01:27:24,122 --> 01:27:27,462
(MINHO's father, Coach Choi Yun Kyum of Yongin FC)

2090
01:27:28,562 --> 01:27:30,402
(MINHO, the son, came to cheer for his father.)

2091
01:27:31,702 --> 01:27:32,962
(Smiling widely)

2092
01:27:33,262 --> 01:27:34,832
(The fierce coach's heart melted?)

2093
01:27:35,732 --> 01:27:37,801
(The coffee truck that MINHO prepared for his father)

2094
01:27:37,802 --> 01:27:38,802
(Let's go, Coach Choi Yun Kyum! From his son, MINHO)

2095
01:27:39,642 --> 01:27:43,112
(Please be nice to my dad.)

2096
01:27:44,282 --> 01:27:46,242
(The son is proud to see people lining up for the truck.)

2097
01:27:46,942 --> 01:27:48,511
(Regardless of being grateful,)

2098
01:27:48,512 --> 01:27:49,752
(MINHO will have to compete.)

2099
01:27:50,422 --> 01:27:51,952
(When it comes to competing, they're not father and son.)

2100
01:27:52,352 --> 01:27:54,622
(The Fiery Father and Son stand on the field.)

2101
01:27:55,252 --> 01:27:58,192
(Getting competitive even before the match)

2102
01:27:58,562 --> 01:28:00,121
(I'm not a professional athlete.)

2103
01:28:00,122 --> 01:28:01,662
(I'm not either.)

2104
01:28:02,262 --> 01:28:04,862
(He's got his fiery side from his father.)

2105
01:28:05,332 --> 01:28:07,202
(Son, I'm the original fiery man.)

2106
01:28:07,902 --> 01:28:09,532
(Father, the world has changed.)

2107
01:28:10,102 --> 01:28:13,811
(An unpredictable match)

2108
01:28:13,812 --> 01:28:15,272
(How would the fiery match end?)

2109
01:28:16,572 --> 01:28:19,681
(I didn't show it earlier.)

2110
01:28:19,682 --> 01:28:21,152
(But I was a bit sad.)

2111
01:28:21,982 --> 01:28:24,782
(They finally talk about what happened that day.)

2112
01:28:26,352 --> 01:28:30,692
(My Forever Flame)

2113
01:28:31,092 --> 01:28:32,291
(The Little Tiger is back.)

2114
01:28:32,292 --> 01:28:33,862
(Roaring)

2115
01:28:34,762 --> 01:28:37,101
(The curious lover of greens)

2116
01:28:37,102 --> 01:28:40,232
(Member Kim Si Hyeon)

2117
01:28:40,802 --> 01:28:43,031
(Walking with excitement)

2118
01:28:43,032 --> 01:28:44,702
(I'm in Tongyeong now.)

2119
01:28:45,572 --> 01:28:46,771
(My 2nd home)

2120
01:28:46,772 --> 01:28:48,472
(Tongyeong)

2121
01:28:49,172 --> 01:28:52,282
(Spring greens have arrived early.)

2122
01:28:53,142 --> 01:28:55,982
(It's full of rare and fresh ingredients.)

2123
01:28:56,212 --> 01:28:58,482
(Whom has she gone to meet as soon as she arrives?)

2124
01:28:58,982 --> 01:29:01,492
(A food researcher of Tongyeong, Lee Sang Hee)

2125
01:29:02,452 --> 01:29:04,521
(A treasured vegetable garden...)

2126
01:29:04,522 --> 01:29:05,822
(overlooking the ocean)

2127
01:29:07,162 --> 01:29:08,162
(Amazed)

2128
01:29:08,692 --> 01:29:12,032
(Harvesting greens from the garden for the first time in her life)

2129
01:29:12,262 --> 01:29:14,002
(The garden is covered with her favorite greens.)

2130
01:29:14,572 --> 01:29:17,142
(Totally satisfied with her spring greens foraging)

2131
01:29:17,702 --> 01:29:19,341
(Utilizing all of her five senses...)

2132
01:29:19,342 --> 01:29:21,712
(to meet new greens)

2133
01:29:22,642 --> 01:29:24,311
(Spitting it out)

2134
01:29:24,312 --> 01:29:26,012
(I ate weeds.)

2135
01:29:26,712 --> 01:29:28,382
(I'm full just like the basket.)

2136
01:29:28,852 --> 01:29:31,982
(The real class will begin now.)

2137
01:29:33,222 --> 01:29:34,692
(Looking serious in the kitchen)

2138
01:29:34,952 --> 01:29:37,192
(Becoming a great chef is a long and difficult journey.)

2139
01:29:37,962 --> 01:29:40,532
(She has come to Tongyeong to find the answer to her journey.)

2140
01:29:40,970 --> 01:29:43,140
(The harder it gets, the more thorough she becomes.)

2141
01:29:44,032 --> 01:29:47,532
(Studying Is the Only Way)
